<title>RUSSIA: Russian Irkutskenergo rises 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian Irkutskenergo rises 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Russian regional utility Irkutskenergo rose 18 percent on the Russian Trading System to $0.242 at 0950 GMT on Tuesday from $0.205 at Monday's close.</p>
<p>Irkutskenergo is one of the most liquid shares on the Russian equities market, which closed at a record high on Monday.</p>
<p>--Peter Henderson, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
